1.75em; visibility: visible;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px; visibility: visible;\">\n  海拔：2000 - 2350 米 masl\n </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal; line-height: 1.75em; visibility: visible;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px; visibility: visible;\">\n  每公顷种植：2200 植株 trees\n  <br style=\"visibility: visible;\"/>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal; line-height: 1.75em; visibility: visible;\">\n<span style=\"text-decoration: underline; visibility: visible;\">\n<strong style=\"visibility: visible;\">\n<span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-size: 14px; visibility: visible;\">\n    批次 Halo 来自Savage庄园\n   </span>\n</strong>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal; line-height: 1.75em; visibility: visible;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px; visibility: visible;\">\n  处理方式：厌氧缓慢干燥日晒 Anaerobic Slow Dried Natural\n </span>\n<br style=\"visibility: visible;\"/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal; line-height: 1.75em; visibility: visible;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px; visibility: visible;\">\n  烘焙度：浅度 Light Roasted\n </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal; line-height: 1.75em; visibility: visible;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px; visibility: visible;\">\n  风味：猕猴桃，菠萝，蓝莓，樱桃，杏脯\n </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal; line-height: 1.75em; visibility: visible;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px; visibility: visible;\">\n  Kiwi, Pineapple, Blue berry, Cherry, Dried apricot\n </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal; line-height: 1.75em; visibility: visible;\">\n<br style=\"visibility: visible;\"/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal; line-height: 1.75em; visibility: visible;\">\n<span style=\"text-decoration: underline; visibility: visible;\">\n<strong style=\"visibility: visible;\">\n<span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-size: 14px; visibility: visible;\">\n    批次 Vivid 来自Deborah庄园\n   </span>\n</strong>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal; line-height: 1.75em; visibility: visible;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px; visibility: visible;\">\n  处理方式：二氧化碳浸渍水洗 Carbonic Maceration Washed\n </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal; line-height: 1.75em; visibility: visible;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px; visibility: visible;\">\n  烘焙度：浅度 Light Roasted\n </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal; line-height: 1.75em; visibility: visible;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px; visibility: visible;\">\n  风味：白色花朵，橙子，青苹果，蜂蜜甜，红糖\n </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal; line-height: 1.75em; visibility: visible;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px; visibility: visible;\">\n  White flower, Orange, green apple, Honeyed sweet, Brown sugar\n </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"visibility: visible;\">\n<br style=\"visibility: visible;\"/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal; text-align: center; visibility: visible;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7QCcTqPiaCB9OxiaaqAtrvrJAibq6RgZONK8Hdg7ntuMtEsJjribBkX065gEG4Wd4NWLQlBXM2w6LtV7Q/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=10005&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=1\" style=\"height: auto !important; visibility: visible !important; width: 680px !important;\"/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;text-align: center;\">\n<br/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n   关于Deborah\n  </span>\n</strong>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 12px;color: rgb(214, 214, 214);\">\n  下面部分文字来源于网络 https://www.gafei.com/banama/20171117112023.html\n </span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n  Finca Deborah是个能源自主的庄园，其处理厂是由太阳能系统供电运作，在此高海拔偏远之地，传统电力系统无法供应处理厂所需的电力，是以庄园找到自己的方式发电。更由于此缘故，庄园得以维持该区环境的完整性与独特性。此外，做为一个荫栽种植庄园，Deborah 与该区山景融为一体，维持原有的自然环境，并维护当地鸟类与野生动物的生活区域。\n </span>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n</span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7RC2JF0bqwt5DuuWQXoap7nHM8DbNtfSvWibQxffgsyEib3XicjG6iaOuLEDO2Nxg9WfRc29ibATRl4UYQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=10005&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=2\" style=\"height: auto !important; visibility: visible !important; width: 680px !important;\"/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n</span>\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n  黛博拉位于\n  <span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n   奇里基\n  </span>\n  省的沃肯火山区，海拔1900米之上，它可能是巴拿马种植咖啡海拔zui高的地方，在这种环境下，夜间最低气温可以低至10c左右，年均降雨量2200毫米，这样的气候使得咖啡果能更缓慢的成长，积聚更多的糖分，豆子更扎实（密度更高），也因此黛博拉的咖啡品质如此之高；2016年世界咖啡师竞赛中，台湾的选手吴泽霖首次以黛博拉水洗瑰夏赢得世界冠军，2017年的世界咖啡师冲煮比赛中，前15名就有7名用得来自黛博拉的瑰夏，而取得第二名的澳洲选手用得也是黛博拉。\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n  现在售卖的批次是Halo（厌氧发酵缓慢干燥日晒）与Vivid（二氧化碳浸渍水洗）两个批次。\n </span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<br/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7Q09FO8svc4MbsT6kYe0icjVt0iafAKEvQb4V0sg5ELeaSJuChicNO6jr9zxGVFVu7wDwt3ibVQgXa5ow/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=10005&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=3\" style=\"height: auto !important; width: 367px !important; visibility: visible !important;\"/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>",
